{"version":1,"key":"card:470","content":{"id":470,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d2423b0-d915-457c-a1b3-44a4189445fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"property"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 Python 中一种特殊的装饰器，它允许您通过定义 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getter"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"deleter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法来控制对类属性的访问。使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"property"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 装饰器可以将方法转换为属性，使其在使用上更加直观和方便。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f41154f1-84ee-4070-b29c-375e0cf6772a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关键点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0f103a94-302b-41ad-807d-560e581972a1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47e2544e-2e4f-4a62-9f84-3bb635d3aa20","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f285aa14-e056-4af7-a17b-48dfa775a206","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"@property"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 装饰器时，被装饰的方法成为属性的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，Python 会将该方法转换为一个只读属性，使得您可以像访问属性一样访问这个方法，而不是调用方法"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bf30d182-bdf0-41d0-b782-5fada4d955b3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a43b1bb-3b66-4f31-b8be-c8c393a6d1f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果需要在设置属性时执行一些额外的操作，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<property_name>.setter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 装饰器来标记一个方法，以实现设置属性值的逻辑，例如执行验证或其他操作"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"827cc620-c3dd-4c8f-96c2-9dbeb071b81f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"046ffa2b-51a0-4610-a728-4e3bc0eb062f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<property_name>.deleter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 装饰器来标记一个方法，以实现删除属性时的逻辑，以便能够对从对象中删除属性时的行为进行自定义处理"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"a4991546-afa4-4e78-bb5a-fda75597aae8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"70170504-b349-4806-8b8d-f0690703b54f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"from math import pi\n\nclass Circle:\n    def __init__(self, radius):\n        self._radius = radius\n\n    @property\n    def radius(self):\n        return self._radius\n\n    @radius.setter\n    def radius(self, value):\n        if value < 0:\n            return;\n        \n        self._radius = value\n\n\n    @radius.deleter\n    def radius(self):\n        del self._radius\n\n    @property\n    def area(self):\n        return pi * self.radius * self.radius\n\nc = Circle(5)\nprint(c.radius, c.area) # 5 78.53981633974483\n\nc.radius = -10\nprint(c.radius, c.area) # 5 78.53981633974483\n\nc.radius = 10\nprint(c.radius, c.area) # 10 314.1592653589793 \n\ndel c.radius","collabId":"dbc04f4b-a648-4831-81d6-23e896f2bb24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"9e1a3ca0-a832-44bd-a24c-5221331db84f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"043d3c93-0a7d-4613-a6e0-c06f27f5edbd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"c.radius\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAttributeError                            Traceback (most recent call last)\nCell In[11], line 1\n----> 1 c.radius\n\nCell In[10], line 9, in Circle.radius(self)\n      7 @property\n      8 def radius(self):\n----> 9     return self._radius\n\nAttributeError: 'Circle' object has no attribute '_radius'","collabId":"8e019879-43f7-4e82-a7fb-cdd856a55849","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"df8caae0-d393-46d5-bd47-05e98f4e2fa4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9bb7413b-cf47-4b62-96f8-1ab30ea23a32","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"property"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 其实并不是函数，而是一个类。它的实例包含一些魔法方法，而所有的魔法都是由这些方法完成的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf657478-9b21-4b36-b509-6d7fcd4ceb23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些魔法方法为"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__get__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__set__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__delete__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们一道定义了所谓的描述符协议。只要对象实现了这些方法中的任何一个，它就是一个描述符。描述符的独特之处在于其访问方式。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"33ca3b87-b3ff-47a3-8ac0-49b743299131","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如，读取属性（具体来说，是在实例中访问类中定义的属性）时，如果它关联的是一个实现了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__get__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的对象，将不会返回这个对象，而是调用方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__get__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并将其结果返回。实际上，这是隐藏在特性、关联的方法、静态方法和类方法以及 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后面的机制。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"163e0789-2c59-4b55-ab43-62f51b6ae4c9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b581fb5a-5b93-445a-9ab9-78091ce2c9f9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Descriptor:\n    def __init__(self, initial_value=None):\n        self._value = initial_value\n\n    def __get__(self, instance, owner):\n        return self._value\n\n    def __set__(self, instance, value):\n        if value < 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"Value must be positive\")\n        self._value = value\n\nclass MyClass:\n    attribute = Descriptor()\n\n# 使用描述符\nobj = MyClass()\nobj.attribute = 42\nprint(obj.attribute)  # 输出: 42\n\nobj.attribute = -10  # 触发描述符的__set__方法，抛出异常","collabId":"bffd0ef9-34b0-4624-805c-4e967372722a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["Python/类","Python/装饰器","Python/魔法方法"],"createTime":1719273231817,"updateTime":1791474923041,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923041}}